  <name>yuki-iptv plus</name>
  <summary>IPTV player with EPG support</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      IPTV player with EPG support. Fork of yuki-iptv with fixes for
      stream recording and recording while watching over a single connection.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>M3U / M3U8 / XSPF playlists and XTream API</li>
      <li>TV programme (EPG) in XMLTV and JTV formats</li>
      <li>Stream recording and scheduled recording</li>
      <li>Record the channel you are watching without opening a second connection</li>
      <li>Per-channel video settings, user agent and HTTP referer</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.serif453.YukiIptvPlus.desktop</launchable>

